+# Round 44 GUI manual acceptance — not run
+Run under an ordinary Windows account.
+1. Launch IDE and resize: no overlapping panes or missing line numbers.
+2. Open Hindi and Tamil UTF-8 examples: keywords highlighted in code, not in comments or strings.
+3. Edit and Save As a filename with Unicode characters; reopen and verify exact content.
+4. Compile and run a short program; inspect output and errors.
+5. Capture actual screenshots, Windows version, app SHA-256, results and failures.
+Successful PE assembly is not proof of visual acceptance.
